-background-color-white\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"typography-h3 color-dark-blue title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t你現正離開<span class=\"font-ambit-bold\">livi bank</span>網站並進入第三方網站。\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t進入該連結將連接至第三方網站。當進入該網站，你提供的所有資料將受制於第三方網站的有關條款及個人資料政策。livi bank對該網站之内容及閣下使用該網站之内容概不負責。 \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cta-container d-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button-container\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a id=\"third-party-website-warning-popup-cancel\" href=\"#\" class=\"button-secondary typography-button text-decoration-none\">取消</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button-container \" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a id=\"third-party-website-warning-popup-proceed\" href=\"#\" class=\"button-primary typography-button text-decoration-none\" >明白並前往第三方網站</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n</header>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"style_common\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/.resources/livibank-templates/webresources/css/importantNotice.css\">\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/js-cookie/2.2.1/js.cookie.min.js\"></script>\n\n<div class=\"topUpBanner-wrapper\">\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/.resources/livibank-templates/webresources/js/importantNotice.js\"></script><main id=\"livi-save\">\n  <section class=\"section-1280 features-subpage-key-visual\">\n    <div class=\"content position-relative\">\n        <div class=\"carousel\" data-carousel=\"true\" data-infinite=\"true\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"section-834 features-subpage-key-visual-item\">\n                    <div class=\"content\">\n                        <div class=\"row no-gutters\">\n                            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\n                                <div class=\"text-content\">\n                                    <h1 class=\"color-dark-blue\"><span class='font-ambit-bold'>liviSave</span><br>讓儲蓄更有價值</h1>\n               