>\n以上活期利率於2024年12月21日起生效。年利率將會按市場環境調整。你可隨時用livi app查看最新年利率。\n                    <div class=\"terms-and-conditions-container\">\n                            <a \n                            href=\"/pdf/livi-save-and-earn-offer-tncs-tc.pdf\" \n                            target=\"_blank\"\n                            rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" \n                            \n                            class=\"typography-xs color-link-blue text-decoration-underline\">條款及細則</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"table-人民幣\" class=\"table-content \" style=\"\">\n                    <table>\n                        <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue\">\n                                <h6>賬戶餘額：</h6>\n                            </th>\n                            <th class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue\">\n                                <h6>年利率</h6>\n                            </th>\n                        </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><p>首人民幣1,000,000元或以下</p></td>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><h4>1.00% p.a.</h4></td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><p>餘額</p></td>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><h4>0.25% p.a.</h4></td>\n                                    </tr>\n                            \n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"footer-人民幣\"\n                    class=\"footer-content \" \n                    style=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"typography-xs\">\n                        年利率以下列年度計算，以單利息基準按日計算（包括閏年和非閏年）：<br>\n•\t港元 – 365天<br>\n•\t人民幣, 美元 – 360 天<br>\n以上活期利率於2024年12月21日起生效。年利率將會按市場環境調整。你可隨時用livi app查看最新年利率。\n                    <div class=\"terms-and-conditions-container\">\n                            <a \n                            href=\"/pdf/livi-save-and-earn-offer-tncs-tc.pdf\" \n                            target=\"_blank\"\n                            rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" \n                            \n                            class=\"typography-xs color-link-blue text-decoration-underline\">條款及細則</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"table-美元\" class=\"table-content \" style=\"\">\n                    <table>\n                        <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue\">\n                                <h6>賬戶餘額：</h6>\n                            </th>\n                            <th class=\"typography-body color-dark-blue\">\n                                <h6>年利率</h6>\n                            </th>\n                        </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><p>所有存款</p></td>\n                                        <td class=\"color-dark-blue\"><h4>3.088% p.a.</h4></td>\n                                    </tr>\n                            \n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"footer-美元\"\n                    class=\"footer-content \" \n                    style=\"\">\n                    <span class=\"typography-xs\">\n                        年利率以下列年度計算，以單利息基準按日計算（包括閏年和非閏年）：<br>\n•\t港元 – 365天<br>\n•\t人民幣, 美元 – 360 天<br>\n以上活期利率於2024年12月21日起生效。年利率將會按市場環境調整。你可隨時用livi app查看最新年利率。\n                    <div class=\"terms-and-conditions-container\">\n                            <a \n   